### DATA
# Same rule as the sibling projects: no data file goes to GitHub. The workbook
# is handed to the stock-and-flow model directly, not through the repository.
# A fresh clone gets the CODE ONLY and cannot run until data/raw/ is supplied
# separately (iCloud, shared drive, however it is distributed).
#
# The whole tree, inputs and generated figures alike -- said once at the folder
# so a new output cannot slip through by having an extension nobody thought to
# list. paths.output_dir writes into figures/; data/ holds the inputs.
/data/
/figures/

# The extensions too, wherever they land outside data/.
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.pkl
*.npy
*.png

# params.xlsx is caught by the *.xlsx rule above and stays untracked. It is a
# generated register, not a source: regenerate it with 00_parameters.py.
